        practiceProblems: [
          { difficulty: 'easy', question: "Name five major international academic olympiads and their subject areas.", questionRu: "Назовите пять крупных международных олимпиад и их предметы.", questionKk: "Бес ірі халықаралық олимпиаданы және олардың пәндерін атаңыз.", answer: "1. IMO — International Mathematical Olympiad (Mathematics), 2. IPhO — International Physics Olympiad (Physics), 3. IChO — International Chemistry Olympiad (Chemistry), 4. IBO — International Biology Olympiad (Biology), 5. IOI — International Olympiad in Informatics (Computer Science).", hint: "Each major science + math + computer science has its own olympiad.", hintRu: "Каждая основная наука + математика + информатика имеет свою олимпиаду.", hintKk: "Әр негізгі ғылым + математика + информатиканың өз олимпиадасы бар.", xp: 5 },
          { difficulty: 'medium', question: "A student solves 50 olympiad problems in a month but doesn't improve. Using the 'deliberate practice' framework, explain what they might be doing wrong and how to fix it.", questionRu: "Ученик решает 50 задач в месяц, но не улучшается. Используя «осознанную практику», объясните ошибку и решение.", questionKk: "Оқушы айына 50 есеп шығарады, бірақ жақсармайды. «Мақсатты жаттығу» арқылы қатені және шешімді түсіндіріңіз.", answer: "Likely problems: (1) Not reviewing errors — solving without analyzing mistakes doesn't build understanding. Fix: Spend equal time analyzing wrong solutions as solving new problems. (2) Not targeting weaknesses — solving easy problems in strong areas doesn't push growth. Fix: Track problem types and focus on categories with lowest success rates. (3) No competition simulation — solving without time pressure doesn't build exam skills. Fix: Weekly timed practice sessions under real conditions.", hint: "Deliberate practice means targeted effort on weaknesses, not just volume.", hintRu: "Осознанная практика — целенаправленная работа над слабостями, а не объём.", hintKk: "Мақсатты жаттығу — көлем емес, әлсіз жақтарға бағытталған күш.", xp: 10 },
          { difficulty: 'hard', question: "You are coaching a team of 4 students for the International Science Olympiad. Each has different strengths: Student A excels in biology, Student B in chemistry, Student C in physics, Student D in math. The competition has 5 events: experimental design, data analysis, content knowledge quiz, team challenge, and presentation. Create a strategic team preparation plan assigning roles and a 3-month training schedule.", questionRu: "Вы тренируете 4 учеников для научной олимпиады. Силы: A — биология, B — химия, C — физика, D — математика. 5 событий: эксперимент, анализ данных, викторина, командное задание, презентация. Стратегический план подготовки.", questionKk: "4 оқушыны ғылыми олимпиадаға дайындап жатырсыз. Күшті жақтары: A — биология, B — химия, C — физика, D — математика. 5 іс-шара: эксперимент, деректер талдауы, викторина, командалық тапсырма, презентация. Стратегиялық дайындық жоспары.", answer: "Role assignments: Experimental design — B (lab skills) + C (physics measurement). Data analysis — D (math/stats lead) + A (biology interpretation). Content quiz — all four, each covering their specialty. Team challenge — all four, with D leading problem-solving logic. Presentation — A (strongest communicator) + C (visual aids). Month 1: Individual content deepening — each studies their specialty plus one cross-training area (A learns basic chemistry, B learns basic physics, etc.). Weekly: 2 practice quizzes, 1 team meeting. Month 2: Event-specific training — practice experiments under timed conditions, data analysis drills with real datasets, mock presentations with feedback. Weekly: 1 full simulation. Month 3: Integration and peak — full competition simulations every weekend, review weaknesses from simulations, mental preparation and stress management, develop team communication signals for team events.", xp: 20 }
        ]
